1gkf|a|Denying; implying, containing, or asserting denial, negation or refusal; returning the answer no to an inquiry or request; refusing assent; as, a negative answer; a negative opinion; -- opposed to affirmative. ; Not positive; without affirmative statement or demonstration; indirect; consisting in the absence of something; privative; as, a negative argument; a negative morality; negative criticism. ; Asserting absence of connection between a subject and a predicate; as, a negative proposition. ; Of or pertaining to a picture upon glass or other material, in which the lights and shades of the original, and the relations of right and left, are reversed. ; Metalloidal; nonmetallic; -- contracted with positive or basic; as, the nitro group is negative.	j:syo,103,3;g9f,89,32;g9e,85,26;1vbc,84,58;24dk,79,13;gbm,78,353;p6n,72,157;1tsc,72,32;14py,71,11;1zrg,70,7;trh,69,6;135d,68,31;5hr,66,14;1w84,64,111;14ri,64,13~gbm,78,353;1358,60,324;trg,55,249;p6c,60,236;1vuk,39,226;fah,42,190;1w5c,32,164;p6n,72,157;1w7x,52,148;1w5j,50,133;2e5h,48,130;28w6,21,115;13i6,54,114;1vub,36,113;1w84,64,111	e:2d2z,58,14;11t3,56,10;1kc6,50,3;1k3x,49,25;2e2s,46,7;2gho,45,3;150n,40,9;21pc,32,34;1scm,32,11;1ptv,29,22;t25,27,28;2519,26,20;jz3,25,4;24yb,25,7;22hc,21,19~2epf,20,248;1f74,6,155;29qk,9,47;21pc,32,34;t25,27,28;19lo,6,26;1k3x,49,25;1tnu,2,23;1ptv,29,22;2519,26,20;22hc,21,19;10xs,16,16;2d2z,58,14;1fc7,13,14;1pom,8,11
